 "final": "Dana Lee's trip is booked, and both reservations show as confirmed.\n\n- **Flight (R0001):** F100, nonstop from SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, for $289. This was the cheapest nonstop. A $199 flight was cheaper, but it has a stop.\n- **Hotel (R0002):** Midtown Lodge in New York at $189/night, checking in 2026-11-12 for 2 nights, for $378 total. This was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. That's under the $1,000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\nThe flight and hotel ended up as two separate bookings instead of one combined trip. The combined booking timed out, and when I checked, only the flight had gone through. Instead of retrying the combined booking, which could have charged for the flight twice, I booked the hotel by itself. Each item has been charged once and nothing is duplicated.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01SETwdZPFnGMPRhHFDoDcCq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01DTNRCbmKmJSzMasSCLkYqx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01V5zMdJoR2f8gpR8yga1Ve9", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_013k28oMLsuxBK41bW7JBD3s", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-2026-11-12"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason"